## Reasons the server gives

server-hosting-reason-owner-only = Only the server owner can do this.
server-hosting-reason-software-disabled = Software changes aren't available on this server.
server-hosting-reason-provider-unavailable = This software can't be set up from here.
server-hosting-reason-busy = Another change is in progress. Try again when it finishes.
server-hosting-reason-plan-expired = The review expired. Review the change again.
server-hosting-reason-changed = The server changed since you opened this. Review again.
server-hosting-reason-no-previous = There's no previous software to restore.
server-hosting-reason-recovery = Restore the previous software first.
server-hosting-reason-not-stopped = The server must be fully stopped.
server-hosting-reason-world-metadata = The server couldn't read this world's saved metadata. Check the world files and try again.
server-hosting-reason-version-unavailable = That version isn't available.
server-hosting-reason-source-failed = The download source returned something unexpected. Try again later.
server-hosting-reason-download-failed = The download didn't complete. Check the server's internet connection and try again.
server-hosting-reason-integrity = The download didn't match its published checksum, so it wasn't used.
server-hosting-reason-java-missing = The server computer doesn't have the Java version this needs.
server-hosting-reason-java-incompatible = The installed Java can't run this version.
server-hosting-reason-storage-low = Not enough free disk space on the server computer.
server-hosting-reason-limit = The download is larger than the server allows.
server-hosting-reason-bind-failed = SFTP couldn't use that address and port. It's still off.
server-hosting-reason-key-invalid = That isn't a public SSH key the server accepts.
server-hosting-reason-key-duplicate = That key is already added.
server-hosting-reason-key-limit = The server has reached its key limit. Revoke an old key first.

